<view class="page bills-page"><view class="title">我的费用</view><view class="subtitle">挂号与诊疗费用，一处查看办理进度。</view><view class="demo-notice"><view class="card-title">演示支付，不扣真实款</view><view class="description">用于虚构测试门店的业务演示。账单、缴费与退款记录同步保存，不调用微信扣款。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}<button class="link" bindtap="records">查看预约记录 ›</button></view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="loading">正在读取费用…</view><view wx:if="{{!authenticated && !busy}}" class="card"><view class="card-title">请先微信登录</view><button type="primary" bindtap="login">微信登录</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!bound && !busy}}" class="card"><view class="card-title">尚未填写本人就诊资料</view><view class="description">费用仅供当前账号对应的本人查看。</view><button type="primary" bindtap="binding">填写就诊资料</button></view><block wx:if="{{bound}}"><scroll-view scroll-x class="fee-filters"><button class="{{filter === 'ALL' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="ALL" bindtap="chooseFilter">全部</button><button class="{{filter === 'PENDING' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="PENDING" bindtap="chooseFilter">待缴费</button><button class="{{filter === 'PAID' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="PAID" bindtap="chooseFilter">已缴费</button><button class="{{filter === 'REFUNDED' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="REFUNDED" bindtap="chooseFilter">退款</button></scroll-view><view wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="bill_id" class="card bill"><view class="row"><view class="card-title">{{item.kindLabel}}</view><text class="badge {{item.status === 'PENDING' ? 'warn' : ''}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view><view class="bill-amount">¥ {{item.amount}}</view><view>{{item.clinic_name}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.dentist_name}}" class="description">{{item.dentist_name}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.status === 'PENDING' && item.expires}}" class="hint">号源保留至 {{item.expires}}（北京时间），请及时办理。</view><view class="hint">账单 {{item.bill_id}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.payment.refund_id}}" class="notice">演示退款已完成 · {{item.payment.refund_reason}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.status === 'PENDING'}}" class="bill-actions"><button type="primary" data-id="{{item.bill_id}}" data-action="pay" bindtap="action" disabled="{{busy || unknown || !item.demo_enabled}}">演示缴费 ¥{{item.amount}}</button><button wx:if="{{item.kind === 'REGISTRATION'}}" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.bill_id}}" data-action="close" bindtap="action" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}">取消待缴挂号</button><view wx:if="{{!item.demo_enabled}}" class="hint">此门店未启用演示支付，请联系门店办理。</view></view><button wx:if="{{item.can_refund}}" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.bill_id}}" data-action="refund" bindtap="action" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}">退号退款</button></view><view wx:if="{{!visible.length && !busy}}" class="empty"><view class="card-title">暂无相关费用</view><view class="description">挂号费按实际配置生成，诊疗费用在到诊治疗并开具费用凭据后产生。</view></view><button wx:if="{{next}}" bindtap="more" disabled="{{busy}}">加载更多费用</button></block><view wx:if="{{unknown}}" class="card"><button type="primary" bindtap="execute" disabled="{{busy}}">重新确认原办理结果</button><button class="link" bindtap="query">查询办理进度</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新费用</button></view>
